### ============================================================
### 06-SpringGateway API Testing (Port: 8106)
### ============================================================

### 1. Basic Route (Path predicate, Header filters, StripPrefix)
GET http://localhost:8106/api/basic/downstream/hello
Accept: application/json

### 2. RewritePath Route (Rewrite /api/legacy -> /downstream/new with query param token=123)
GET http://localhost:8106/api/legacy/sample?token=123
Accept: application/json

### 3. Circuit Breaker Route (Triggers fallback on error)
GET http://localhost:8106/api/flaky/downstream/error
Accept: application/json

### 4. Rate Limited Route (Headers predicate + InMemory Rate Limiter)
GET http://localhost:8106/api/limited/downstream/hello
X-RateLimit-App: my-app
Accept: application/json

### 5. Direct Fallback Endpoint
GET http://localhost:8106/fallback
Accept: application/json
